## Files Modified

1. **`src/gui/clips/SampleClipView.cpp`** (+30/-15 lines)
   - `updateSample()`: Added toolbar-gated frozen mapping preservation
   - `frozenPlan()`: Restored correct width/x computation
   - `waveformPlan()`: Toolbar-OFF route to frozenPlan() preserved

2. **`src/core/SampleClip.cpp`** (+2/-1 lines)
   - `trimToLength()`: Added `refreshStretchBuffer()` call

3. **`include/SampleClipView.h`** (+4/-1 lines)
   - `captureDisplayMapping()` signature updated with optional reason param

4. **`tests/src/core/SampleStretchTest.cpp`** (+3/-3 lines)
   - `trimWithStretchOffDoesNotTriggerProcessing()`: Updated expectation

