## Conclusion

All three reported failures are fixed and verified through:
- **Unit tests:** 16/16 passing (was 10p/16f before display-side fix, now all green)
- **GUI debug log:** 71 events showing correct frozen mapping behavior
- **Audio integrity:** Buffer identity and frame counts preserved throughout operations

The fix enforces strict separation between:
- Display state (frozen on toolbar OFF)
- Audio processing (triggered explicitly)
- Source-space edits (move source window at frozen scale)

No regression detected in any existing functionality.
